  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ！　お金みっけ！　ラッキー！！
……って、あ……ビンのふたか。ちっ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, hey, I found a coin! Lucky~!
...Wait, this is just a bottle cap. Dammit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50812</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よしなよ、&lt;Dio&gt;、みっともない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, &lt;Dio&gt;, don't be crude!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うるせー！　今のオレは盗賊！
金目のものは見逃がさねーぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shut up! I'm a thief now, see?
Money's what I'm all about!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51012</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……いつもとそんなにかわらないじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You're usually kind of like this, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51092</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんなことない！　な、エト？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's not true! Right, &lt;Ethos&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51176</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え？　そ、そう、だった、かな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Oh, um... I guess so...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっ、エト……！　目そらすなよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dammit, &lt;Ethos&gt;! No running away!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51356</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……あ！　おまえならわかるよな、&lt;Couleur&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ah! You get me, right, &lt;Couleur&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルール？　クル？　クルルン？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51556</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ほら、&lt;Couleur&gt;もこう言ってんぞ。
盗賊のオレの目にくるいはねーぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>See? &lt;Couleur&gt;'s got my back. &lt;Dio&gt;
the Thief's the best judge there is.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51648</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……そのでまかせっぷりが盗賊っぽいよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...The way you run your
mouth is kind of thief-ish...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだと！　おまえ、盗賊をバカにすんなよ！
盗賊はひとすじの流れ星の男の美学なんだぞ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whaa!? Hey, don't diss thieves! Thievery is the rizz of a
man whose life is that of a single star, blazing in the sky!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51860</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……意味わかんないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I...don't know what that means...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51924</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いいじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's okay.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52060</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今の&lt;Dio&gt;は盗賊だからお金にせこい。
いつもの&lt;Dio&gt;はお金にせこい、これでＯＫでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right now, &lt;Dio&gt;'s a thief, and he's greedy.
Normal &lt;Dio&gt;'s also greedy. And that's okay.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52148</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_162_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はーい
は～い……ん？？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okaaay.
Okaa—huh...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
